bin/
obj/
*.user
*.suo
.vs/
.dotnet/
TestResults/

# Unity (cuando se añada src/App/AntSim.Unity)
[Ll]ibrary/
[Tt]emp/
[Oo]bj/
[Bb]uild/
[Bb]uilds/
[Ll]ogs/
[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
[Mm]emoryCaptures/
[Rr]ecordings/
